// @category: platform — the device
// @charter: §7.3, §7.9
// @milestone: E5
//
// The device exists where the user is. `device.*` is granted by the browser
// world and by no other, which is what makes a geolocation read inside an
// origin-placed query a placement error (corpus R-025) rather than a runtime
// failure in production.

